    "description": "What: AQ97 D (CE-2322) - two civilians have been ORDERED to stand where they are (task Idle - not their routine HSM) a few metres from a soldier a hostile rifleman is shooting at (soldiers immortal; civilians are never targeted). 'Ordered' carries no SOP in the file, so he gets the civilian default (CivilianSop); 'Inert civilian' is stamped InertSop. Judge: (1) the gunfire frightens both (their fear rises - the fear system now keeps it for a civilian on any task); (2) Ordered reacts on top of his order - his task becomes CivilianReact: he stops and crouches (Alarmed), and if his fear passes panic he looks for a door or cowers; (3) Inert civilian keeps standing (task Idle) however frightened. Fail: Ordered stands upright through the shooting, or Inert civilian reacts. Check: python3 scripts/utility-demo-check.py --launch df-civilian-ordered"
  },
